# Things the repository shows or tools leave behind, none of which the build
# reads. `media/` is the README's screenshots, written by `pnpm media`, and
# what the app actually serves lives in `apps/web/public/`. `.agents/` is
# third-party skills pulled by `npx skills`, already gitignored.
media
.agents
_artifacts
.playwright-mcp

# The sharded dependency indexes. Nine thousand entries an agent reads from a
# checkout; the site never imports them and the runtime image never sees them,
# so they are two and a half megabytes of build context that only slows the
# copy down.
packages/cli/references

*.log
.DS_Store
.env
.env.*
